        "text": "Step 1: Identify the angles related to the parallel lines and transversal.\nSince $\\overline{ST} \\parallel \\overline{QR}$ and $\\overline{SP}$ is a transversal, $\\angle Q$ and $\\angle QSR$ are corresponding angles. Therefore, $\\angle QSR = \\angle Q = 35^\\circ$."
