        "text": "Step 3: Solve for $\\angle QPS$.\n\\[x + 75^\\circ = 180^\\circ,\\]\n\\[x = 180^\\circ - 75^\\circ = 105^\\circ.\\]\nSo, $\\angle QPS = 105^\\circ$."
      },
